id: get-up
name: Get Up!
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
source: Villainous Maneuver
# A Villainous Maneuver (the Adversaries page): "a form of Special Maneuver that all Adversaries have access to" - every
# Adversary's, given with its sheet and on the Maneuvers tab's Villainous tab; what it does, villainous.mjs.
special: true
description: >
  I’m not done with you yet!
text: >
  Get Up! [1/Round]: I’m not done with you yet!
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Defeated Opponent. They stop being Defeated and have their Life Points set to 1/10th of their Maximum Life Points. This effect counts for Will to Survive (see – Damage & Recovery).
  You cannot target this Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver until the end of their next turn.

